{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/gif1111.gif?t=1744379041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Party Madness is a 2-4 player online party game. Compete with your friends in wacky mini-games, collect points, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIQUE MINIGAMES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mini-game in Party Madness is pure chaos! One moment you're escaping an angry octopus in the ocean, the next you're in the middle of a bank heist dodging lasers \u2014 and just when you think it\u2019s over, you\u2019re driving through a desert with meteors raining down on you. Dodge, laugh, and grab the cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/Minigames-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744379041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EVERY GAME IS A NEW CHALLENGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you face off against your friends, each game throws a different challenge your way. Race with cars, battle on boats, or outsmart your opponents in a variety of mini-games using different strategies to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/gameplay-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1.gif?t=1744379041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COSTUMES &amp; CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character with a wide range of costumes inspired by pirates, astronauts, samurais, and more! Unlock new outfits as you play and show off your unique style in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/PickYourStyle-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1.gif?t=1744379041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to dive into a world of crazy fun! Party Madness is packed with non-stop action, laughs, and unexpected adventures. The madness awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3150970?t=1744379041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3150970?t=1744379041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/907d7e00511bccd5c132ebdbe09d7a54f065ea35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744379041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/907d7e00511bccd5c132ebdbe09d7a54f065ea35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744379041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/gif1111.gif?t=1744379041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Party Madness is a 2-4 player online party game. Compete with your friends in wacky mini-games, collect points, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIQUE MINIGAMES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mini-game in Party Madness 